es clean hierarchy, comfortably readable text, strong multi-screen consistency, controlled color palettes, non-generic creative direction, textured surfaces, image-led composition, tasteful custom iconography, and clean phone mockup framing. By default, screens should be shown inside a subtle premium iPhone or similar phone mockup with a visible frame, while the main focus stays on the app content itself. This skill generates images only. It does not write code.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/imagegen-frontend-mobile", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"imagegen-frontend-web", Name:"imagegen-frontend-web", Description:"Elite frontend image-direction skill for generating premium, conversion-aware website design references. CRITICAL OUTPUT RULE — generate ONE separate horizontal image FOR EVERY section. A landing page with 8 sections produces 8 images. Never compress multiple sections into one image. Enforces composition variety (not always left-text / right-image), background-image freedom, varied CTAs, varied hero scales (giant / mid / mini minimalist), narrative concept spine, second-read moments, and a single consistent palette across all images. Optimized for landing pages, marketing sites, and product comps that developers or coding models can accurately recreate.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/imagegen-frontend-web", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"implement", Name:"implement", Description:"Implement a piece of work based on a spec or set of tickets.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/implement", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"implement-spec", Name:"implement-spec", Description:"Implement a specification in code.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/implement-spec", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", 